(text "RSLATCH_J2N16 testbench (tools/kicad/gen_latch_j2n16.py, stimulus and .meas from tools/spice/latch_tb.py).\nSTIM_x (HV PWL, ideal) -> divider -> driver triode (Ra 10k) -> divider -> x (LV DUT input): real edges and levels.\nEach output -> one divider (C1 3.9 pF per grid) -> x_LV -> load tubes, both grids on the net.\nStates (S,R,E) 2 us each: 011 000 100 101 100 010 011 001 101 001 011 000 (latch_sweep.SEQ).\nThe plain-SPICE run of the same bench: python3 tools/spice/latch_tb.py" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "48beb601-4181-4efe-8f88-dba3860de7ea"))
(text ".meas tran q0 find v(/Q) at=1.95u\n.meas tran q1 find v(/Q) at=3.95u\n.meas tran q2 find v(/Q) at=5.95u\n.meas tran q3 find v(/Q) at=7.95u\n.meas tran q4 find v(/Q) at=9.95u\n.meas tran q5 find v(/Q) at=11.95u\n.meas tran q6 find v(/Q) at=13.95u\n.meas tran q7 find v(/Q) at=15.95u\n.meas tran q8 find v(/Q) at=17.95u\n.meas tran q9 find v(/Q) at=19.95u\n.meas tran q10 find v(/Q) at=21.95u\n.meas tran q11 find v(/Q) at=23.95u\n.meas tran n0 find v(/QN) at=1.95u\n.meas tran n1 find v(/QN) at=3.95u\n.meas tran n2 find v(/QN) at=5.95u\n.meas tran n3 find v(/QN) at=7.95u\n.meas tran n4 find v(/QN) at=9.95u\n.meas tran n5 find v(/QN) at=11.95u\n.meas tran n6 find v(/QN) at=13.95u\n.meas tran n7 find v(/QN) at=15.95u\n.meas tran n8 find v(/QN) at=17.95u\n.meas tran n9 find v(/QN) at=19.95u\n.meas tran n10 find v(/QN) at=21.95u\n.meas tran n11 find v(/QN) at=23.95u\n.meas tran smin min v(/S) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran rmin min v(/R) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran emin min v(/E) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran lqmin min v(/DUT/FQ) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran lqnmin min v(/DUT/FQN) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran yqmin min v(/Q_LV) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran lqmax max v(/DUT/FQ) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran lqnmax max v(/DUT/FQN) from=0.5u to=24.0u\n.meas tran lqlv find v(/DUT/FQ) at=1.95u\n.meas tran lqnlv find v(/DUT/FQN) at=1.95u\n.meas tran yqlv find v(/Q_LV) at=1.95u\n.meas tran er_qr trig v(/E) val=-5 rise=1 td=5.9u targ v(/Q) val=100 rise=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran er_qrn trig v(/E) val=-5 rise=1 td=5.9u targ v(/QN) val=100 fall=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran er_qf trig v(/E) val=-5 rise=1 td=11.9u targ v(/Q) val=100 fall=1 td=11.9u\n.meas tran er_qfn trig v(/E) val=-5 rise=1 td=11.9u targ v(/QN) val=100 rise=1 td=11.9u\n.meas tran sr_qr trig v(/S) val=-5 rise=1 td=15.9u targ v(/Q) val=100 rise=1 td=15.9u\n.meas tran sr_qrn trig v(/S) val=-5 rise=1 td=15.9u targ v(/QN) val=100 fall=1 td=15.9u\n.meas tran rr_qf trig v(/R) val=-5 rise=1 td=19.9u targ v(/Q) val=100 fall=1 td=19.9u\n.meas tran rr_qfn trig v(/R) val=-5 rise=1 td=19.9u targ v(/QN) val=100 rise=1 td=19.9u\n.meas tran gq1 max v(/Q) from=2.05u to=4.00u\n.meas tran gn1 min v(/QN) from=2.05u to=4.00u\n.meas tran gq2 max v(/Q) from=4.05u to=6.00u\n.meas tran gn2 min v(/QN) from=4.05u to=6.00u\n.meas tran gq4 min v(/Q) from=8.05u to=10.00u\n.meas tran gn4 max v(/QN) from=8.05u to=10.00u\n.meas tran gq5 min v(/Q) from=10.05u to=12.00u\n.meas tran gn5 max v(/QN) from=10.05u to=12.00u\n.meas tran gq7 max v(/Q) from=14.05u to=16.00u\n.meas tran gn7 min v(/QN) from=14.05u to=16.00u\n.meas tran gq9 min v(/Q) from=18.05u to=20.00u\n.meas tran gn9 max v(/QN) from=18.05u to=20.00u\n.meas tran gq11 max v(/Q) from=22.05u to=24.00u\n.meas tran gn11 min v(/QN) from=22.05u to=24.00u" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2791c71c-6bd0-4c59-bf5e-426b39fd05ef"))
